OL,3,AGirl, 13, among 33 UK nationals missing
OL,4,Aafter Nepal flash floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said he is
OL,7,Fin touch with local authorities and
OL,8,F"will do everything we can" to support
OL,9,FBritish nationals, urging those in the
OL,10,Fregion "to follow guidance from the
OL,11,Flocal authorities and follow our travel
OL,12,Fadvice". A 13-year-old is the youngest
OL,13,Fperson from the UK still missing.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
